M03 soft-lock: secondary objective 1002 (village SAM sites) is completed only
by the end callback of M03CON020. M03CON020 is not a key conversation
(m03.ldd VARID_ISKEY 0). ActiveConversationClass::Start_Conversation stops a
non-key conversation at once (INTERRUPTED) while a key conversation is
playing, before the script's Monitor_Conversation registers, so 100020 is
never delivered. M03CON026 (shore SAM briefing) and M03CON005 (keycard
officer) are key conversations that can be playing when the second village
SAM dies.

Start a 30 s fallback timer next to M03CON020 and credit 1002 once, from
whichever comes first: the conversation end or the timer. M03CON020 has two
remarks and ends well inside 30 s, so on the normal path the conversation
reports first and the timer finds the report already made.

